Assignment 1
Use Case: Predicting Diabetes Risk in Patients
1. Data
Sources: EHRs(Elctronic health records of patients), wearable devices, health surveys, insurance records.
Issues: Missing values, data imbalance, privacy concerns, inconsistent formats, noisy data.
Types:
Structured: Age, glucose, BMI.
Unstructured: Doctor’s notes.
Time-Series: Blood sugar trends.
Categorical: Gender, family history.
Numerical: Blood pressure, insulin levels.
2. Problem Statement:
"Develop an ML model to predict diabetes risk based on health parameters,
enabling early detection and prevention."
